-- The Bookkeeping area (docs/plan.md §1.79, B-1, M51): the client's chart of accounts and what each
-- account is for (platform tables, filled by the accounting connector's sync), and the Bookkeeping
-- pack's tables: the bank feed's accounts linked to the chart, its transactions, the client's rules
-- and the bookings proposed for each transaction. New tables only, so the previous Worker keeps
-- working. Generated by drizzle-kit from packages/db/src/schema.ts and
